      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did the right thing with the company whistleblower stuff but now i have nothing. no job, no friends, even my family won't talk to me cuz they think i'm the problem. i lost everything for \"integrity\" and it feels like a joke. there's just nothing left for me here.",
